| Kept | {{ f.backup.keep.daily }} daily, {{ f.backup.keep.weekly }} weekly and {{ f.backup.keep.monthly }} monthly *snapshots* per server |
| Password | `{{ groups["recovery"] }}/Backup (restic)` in the credentials file |

